5. PERSONAL SLUG NAMES

Implement a complete custom slug naming system.

Every individual slug instance must be independently nameable.

A slug must have:

Its species identity.

Its unique instance UID.

Its official species name.

Its player-customized nickname, if set.

Its existing stats, bonds, mastery, progression, and other attributes.

The custom name must never replace the species ID or official species name.

5.1 Naming behavior

Players should be able to:

