They must survive:

Saving and loading.

Game restarts.

Changing active team.

Moving slugs between habitats.

Moving slugs into or out of the home.

Evolution.

Megamorph transformations.

Collection sorting.

Save migration.

Do not store custom names only by species ID.

Do not create duplicate slug instances when renaming.

Do not break existing slug UIDs, stats, bonds, mastery, or progression.

5.3 Validation and UX

